Installs include/libinput-properties.h to /usr/include/xorg/ in
package() - upstream's meson.build never installs this public header at
all, and lxqt-config-input needs it (touchpaddevice.cpp). Search path
choice (/usr/include/xorg, not plain /usr/include) matches what
lxqt-config's own build already looks for, following the usual X.Org
driver-headers convention.
